#
# The patch files keep git format-patch's own form, in which a blank
# context line is a single space and an indented one starts with a space
# and a tab; Git's whitespace checks therefore skip them, as they skip the
# patch files under cheri/. firmware/build.sh applies each patch with
# git apply --whitespace=error, so the lines that a patch adds are still
# checked.
*.patch -whitespace
